msgid "Search query (see :doc:`/server-side-search/syntax`)"
msgstr "搜索查询（参见 :doc:`/server-side-search/syntax` ）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:21
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:195
