msgstr "跳转到指定页面"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:22
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:196
msgid "Limits the results per page, default is 50"
msgstr "限制每页结果数，默认为 50"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst
msgid "Request JSON Object"
msgstr "请求 JSON 对象"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:26
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:200
msgid "The type of the result, currently page is the only type."
msgstr "结果类型，目前 page 是唯一类型。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:27
msgid "The project object"
msgstr "项目对象"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:28
msgid "The version object"
msgstr "版本对象"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:29
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:204
msgid "The title of the page"
msgstr "页面标题"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:30
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:205
msgid "Canonical domain of the resulting page"
msgstr "结果页面的规范域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:31
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:206
msgid "Path to the resulting page"
msgstr "结果页面的路径"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:32
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:207
msgid ""
"An object containing a list of substrings with matching terms. Note that the"
" text is HTML escaped with the matching terms inside a ``<span>`` tag."
msgstr "包含匹配词子串列表的对象。注意文本已做 HTML 转义，匹配词位于 ``<span>`` 标签内。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:34
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:209
msgid ""
"A list of block objects containing search results from the page. Currently, "
"there is one type of block:  - section: A page section with a linkable "
"anchor (``id`` attribute)."
msgstr "包含页面搜索结果的块对象列表。目前只有一种块类型： - section: 带可链接锚点（``id`` 属性）的页面章节。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:36
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:211
msgid ""
"A list of block objects containing search results from the page. Currently, "
"there is one type of block:"
msgstr "包含页面搜索结果的块对象列表。目前只有一种块类型："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:39
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:214
msgid "section: A page section with a linkable anchor (``id`` attribute)."
msgstr "section: 带可链接锚点（``id`` 属性）的页面章节。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:43
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:218
msgid ""
"Except for highlights, any other content is not HTML escaped, you shouldn't "
"include it in your page without escaping it first."
msgstr "除高亮部分外，其他内容均未做 HTML 转义，不应未经转义直接放入页面。"

