msgid "**Example response**:"
msgstr "**响应示例** ："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:132
msgid "Migrating from API v2"
msgstr "从 API v2 迁移"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:134
msgid ""
"Instead of using query arguments to specify the project and version to "
"search, you need to do it from the query itself, this is if you had the "
"following parameters:"
msgstr "你不再用查询参数指定要搜索的项目和版本，而需直接在查询中指定。即若原本使用以下参数："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:138
msgid "project: docs"
msgstr "project: docs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:139
msgid "version: latest"
msgstr "version: latest"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:140
msgid "q: test"
msgstr "q: test"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:142
msgid "Now you need to use:"
msgstr "现在需改用："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:144
msgid "q: project:docs/latest test"
msgstr "q: project:docs/latest test"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:146
msgid "The response of the API is very similar to V2, with the following changes:"
msgstr "API 响应与 V2 非常相似，但有以下变化："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:149
msgid "``project`` is an object, not a string."
msgstr "``project`` 是对象而非字符串。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:150
msgid "``version`` is an object, not a string."
msgstr "``version`` 是对象而非字符串。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:151
msgid "``project_alias`` isn't present, it is contained in the ``project`` object."
msgstr "``project_alias`` 不再单独出现，包含在 ``project`` 对象中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:154
msgid ""
"When searching on a parent project, results from their subprojects won't be "
"included automatically, to include results from subprojects use the "
"``subprojects`` parameter."
msgstr "在父项目上搜索时，其子项目的结果不会自动包含。要包含子项目结果，请使用 ``subprojects`` 参数。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:159
msgid "Authentication and authorization"
msgstr "认证与授权"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:161
msgid ""
"If you are using :ref:`private versions <versions:Version states>`, users "
"will only be allowed to search projects they have permissions over. "
"Authentication and authorization is done using the current session, or any "
"of the valid :doc:`sharing methods </commercial/sharing>`."
msgstr ""
"若使用 :ref:`私有版本 <versions:Version states>` ，用户只能搜索其有权限的项目。认证与授权通过当前会话或任一有效的 "
":doc:`共享方式 </commercial/sharing>` 完成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:168
msgid ":doc:`/api/v3`"
msgstr ":doc:`/api/v3`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:169
msgid ""
"You can create and revoke sharing methods programmatically from "
"``/api/v3/projects/<project_slug>/sharing/``."
msgstr "你可以通过 ``/api/v3/projects/<project_slug>/sharing/`` 以编程方式创建和撤销共享方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:171
msgid ""
"To be able to use the user's current session you need to use the API from "
"the domain where your docs are being served (``<you-docs-"
"domain>/_/api/v3/search/``). This is ``https://docs.readthedocs-"
"hosted.com/_/api/v3/search/`` for the ``https://docs.readthedocs-"
"hosted.com/`` project, for example."
msgstr ""
"要使用用户当前会话，需从文档实际提供服务的域名调用 API（``<you-docs-domain>/_/api/v3/search/`` ）。例如 "
"``https://docs.readthedocs-hosted.com/`` 项目对应的是 ``https://docs.readthedocs-"
"hosted.com/_/api/v3/search/`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:177
msgid "API v2 (deprecated)"
msgstr "API v2（已弃用）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:181
msgid ""
"Please use our :ref:`server-side-search/api:api v3` instead, see :ref"
":`server-side-search/api:migrating from api v2`."
msgstr ""
"请改用我们的 :ref:`server-side-search/api:api v3` ，参见 :ref:`server-side-"
"search/api:migrating from api v2` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/server-side-search/api.rst:186
msgid ""
"Return a list of search results for a project, including results from its "
":doc:`/subprojects`. Results are divided into sections with highlights of "
"the matching term."
msgstr "返回某个项目的搜索结果列表，包含其 :doc:`/subprojects` 的结果。结果按章节划分，并高亮匹配的词。"

